,"events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105528#pullrequestreview-2800584648","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105528","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105528#pullrequestreview-2800584648"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105528"}},"submitted_at":"2025-04-28T20:04:07Z","commit_id":null},{"id":2801126620,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6m9czc","user":{"login":"kitbdev","id":10054226,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDU0MjI2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10054226?u=f0c85fe8c24debe91dc14d7efa97b51a19250b47&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev","html_url":"https://github.com/kitbdev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Tested it, using autocomplete doesn't add parenthesis when it should.\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f4b0314e-977b-470f-b870-13fbd286de19)\r\n","state":"CHANGES_REQUESTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105528#pullrequestreview-2801126620","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105528","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105528#pullrequestreview-2801126620"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105528"}},"submitted_at":"2025-04-28T22:17:39Z","commit_id":null},{"id":2804208759,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6nJNR3","user":{"login":"tehKaiN","id":16180344,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MTgwMzQ0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16180344?u=4b576ae2fa5ba4b3a52dab8eee4b930f8f3bab19&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tehKaiN","html_url":"https://github.com/tehKaiN","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tehKaiN/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tehKaiN/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tehKaiN/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tehKaiN/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tehKaiN/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tehKaiN/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tehKaiN/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tehKaiN/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tehKaiN/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Now it behaves better:\r\n\r\n![obraz](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/55f2830f-be8c-4d80-93fd-8febe1bf3ef1)\r\n\r\nafter pressing ctrl+space:\r\n\r\n![obraz](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/09a54b32-68c3-400e-9379-8a04df3109cb)\r\n\r\nBut there's still a problem with one case:\r\n\r\n```gdscript\r\nextends Control\r\n\r\nfunc _physics_prcess(delta: float) -> void:\r\n\tpass\r\n\r\nfunc _(delta: float)\r\n\r\nfunc _process(delta: float) -> void:\r\n\tpass\r\n```\r\n\r\n![obraz](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4f29a289-b08e-46aa-8f3b-9523d4b6df89)\r\n\r\nIt changes to non-parenthesis completion as soon as there's any other character in method name instead of plain underscore. The reason is that `parse_function()` early returns on finding underscore alone and doesn't continue to look for parenthesis after it, as it doesn't find `GDScriptTokenizer::Token::IDENTIFIER` - it finds `GDScriptTokenizer::Token::UNDERSCORE` instead.\r\n\r\nI tried to add some extra logic to continue parsing the function when UNDERSCORE is found, but it resulted in parser errors in other parts of the code. I'd probably need to add some kind of lookahead or rewinding tokenizer to allow doing a try and parse in search of opening parenthesis and going to previous state if it fails, but I'm not sure if that's desired since I don't see such stuff anywhere else and would probably mean putting some extra work in the tokenizer.\r\n\r\nWhat's the preferred course of action here? Is this good enough, as it solves most of cases, or should I continue digging so that it's 100% correct in all foreseeable cases?","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105528#pullrequestreview-2804208759","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105528","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105528#pullrequestreview-2804208759"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105528"}},"submitted_at":"2025-04-29T16:19:04Z","commit_id":null}]